<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">个人信息</view>
    <view class="subtitle">识别排班图后，会优先用这里的姓名在名单里匹配你。</view>

    <view class="form-item" style="margin-top: 24rpx;">
      <text class="form-label">姓名</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        placeholder="例如 张三"
        value="{{name}}"
        data-field="name"
        bindinput="onField"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="form-label">工号（可选，用于更精确匹配）</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        placeholder="例如 0001"
        value="{{employeeNo}}"
        data-field="employeeNo"
        bindinput="onField"
      />
    </view>

    <button class="btn" bindtap="save" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving || loading}}">
      保存
    </button>
  </view>

  <view class="muted" style="padding: 0 12rpx;">
    同名较多时建议填写工号；识别结果仍可手动改选。
  </view>
</view>
